{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49576","headline":"小重山 · 毛熙震","name":"小重山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁燕双飞画阁前，寂寥多少恨，嬾孤眠。\n晓来闲处想君怜，红罗帐，金鸭冷沈烟。\n谁信损婵娟，倚屏啼玉筯，湿香钿。\n四支无力上秋千，羣花谢，愁对艳阳天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}